{"markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"","toc":false,"pagetitle":"Wei Xu | 徐伟"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n<section class=\"wx-hero\">\n<svg class=\"wx-hero-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n  <path d=\"M20 195 H60\"/>\n  <path d=\"M60 120 V270\"/>\n  <path d=\"M60 120 H140\"/>\n  <path d=\"M60 270 H300\"/>\n  <path d=\"M140 60 V180\"/>\n  <path d=\"M140 60 H220\"/>\n  <path d=\"M140 180 H220\"/>\n  <path d=\"M220 30 V90\"/>\n  <path d=\"M220 30 H300\"/>\n  <path d=\"M220 90 H300\"/>\n  <path d=\"M220 150 V210\"/>\n  <path d=\"M220 150 H300\"/>\n  <path d=\"M220 210 H300\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 15 V45\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 15 H380\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 45 H380\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 75 V105\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 75 H380\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 105 H380\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 135 V165\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 135 H380\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 165 H380\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 195 V225\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 195 H380\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 225 H380\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 255 V285\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 255 H380\"/>\n  <path d=\"M300 285 H380\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g fill=\"currentColor\">\n  <circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"15\" r=\"3.4\"/><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"45\" r=\"3.4\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"75\" r=\"3.4\"/><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"105\" r=\"3.4\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"135\" r=\"3.4\"/><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"165\" r=\"3.4\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"195\" r=\"3.4\"/><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"225\" r=\"3.4\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"255\" r=\"3.4\"/><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"285\" r=\"3.4\"/>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n\n<div class=\"wx-hero-inner\">\n  <p class=\"wx-eyebrow\">Macroevolution · Macroecology · Conservation</p>\n  <h1 class=\"wx-name\">Wei Xu<span class=\"wx-cn\">徐伟</span></h1>\n  <p class=\"wx-role\">Postdoctoral researcher, <strong>Tel Aviv University</strong>, Israel</p>\n  <p class=\"wx-tagline\">I study how Earth history, climate and traits build the biodiversity we see today &mdash; from Himalayan amphibians to Malagasy rainforest trees &mdash; and how that knowledge becomes conservation on the ground.</p>\n  <ul class=\"wx-chips\">\n   <li>Phylogenetics</li><li>Biogeography</li><li>Diversity patterns</li>\n   <li>Trait evolution</li><li>Mountains</li><li>Tropical rainforest</li>\n   <li>Conservation planning</li>\n  </ul>\n  <div class=\"wx-actions\">\n   <a class=\"wx-btn wx-btn-solid\" href=\"publications.html\">Publications</a>\n   <a class=\"wx-btn\" href=\"cv.html\">CV</a>\n   <a class=\"wx-btn\" href=\"DataCode.html\">Software &amp; data</a>\n   <a class=\"wx-btn\" href=\"mailto:xuwei.evo@gmail.com\">E-mail</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<p class=\"wx-section-label\">In numbers</p>\n\n<div class=\"wx-metrics\">\n  <div><span class=\"wx-metric-v\">16</span><span class=\"wx-metric-k\">Publications</span></div>\n  <div><span class=\"wx-metric-v\">517</span><span class=\"wx-metric-k\">Citations</span></div>\n  <div><span class=\"wx-metric-v\">8</span><span class=\"wx-metric-k\">h-index</span></div>\n  <div><span class=\"wx-metric-v\">4</span><span class=\"wx-metric-k\">Countries worked in</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"wx-section-label\">What I work on</p>\n\n<div class=\"wx-grid\">\n  <div class=\"wx-card\">\n  <h3>Mountains as diversity engines</h3>\n  <p>How uplift and climate history shaped the Himalaya, the Qinghai&ndash;Tibetan Plateau and the Hengduan Mountains &mdash; and why different vertebrate groups answered the same geology in different ways.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wx-card\">\n  <h3>Hidden biodiversity</h3>\n  <p>Cryptic species quietly redraw the map of what needs protecting. Genome-wide data reveal hotspots that species lists alone never showed.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wx-card\">\n  <h3>Traits in tropical rainforests</h3>\n  <p>Functional and phylogenetic diversity in Annonaceae: frugivory traits, Madagascar's endemic flora, and what they imply for conservation.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wx-card\">\n  <h3>Reproducible biogeography</h3>\n  <p>Building tools &mdash; such as <a href=\"DataCode.html\">BioGeoSyn</a> &mdash; so biogeographic inference is repeatable and comparable across clades, not bespoke per study.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"wx-section-label\">Selected recent work</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wx-highlights\">\n  <li><span class=\"wx-venue\">bioRxiv 2026</span><span><strong>BioGeoSyn</strong> — a graphical software for reproducible biogeographic analyses and cross-clade synthesis. <a href=\"https://github.com/XuWeiEvo/BioGeoSyn\">GitHub</a></span></li>\n  <li><span class=\"wx-venue\">Science 2026</span><span>Stop the biodiversity sampling arms race.</span></li>\n  <li><span class=\"wx-venue\">Biol. Conserv. 2026</span><span>Diversity, distribution and conservation of Annonaceae in Madagascar.</span></li>\n  <li><span class=\"wx-venue\">Proc. B 2025</span><span>Earth history and trait innovation drive the global radiation of modern toads.</span></li>\n  <li><span class=\"wx-venue\">PNAS 2024</span><span>Hidden hotspots of amphibian biodiversity in China.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"wx-section-label\">Elsewhere</p>\n\n<div class=\"wx-actions\">\n  <a class=\"wx-btn\" href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4184-3982\">ORCID</a>\n  <a class=\"wx-btn\" href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&amp;user=YOxNTyAAAAAJ\">Google Scholar</a>\n  <a class=\"wx-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/XuWeiEvo\">GitHub</a>\n  <a class=\"wx-btn\" href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Wei-Xu-312\">ResearchGate</a>\n</div>\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n<section class=\"wx-hero\">\n<svg class=\"wx-hero-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n  <path d=\"M20 195 H60\"/>\n  <path d=\"M60 120 V270\"/>\n  <path d=\"M60 120 H140\"/>\n  <path d=\"M60 270 H300\"/>\n  <pa